{"id":"575e49f7e8ce8f6f","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-expander-walk-extractor.md","title":"由扩展图游走提取弱随机源","display":"thm-expander-walk-extractor — 由扩展图游走提取弱随机源","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-expander-walk-extractor","aliases":["28-thm-expander-walk-extractor"],"display":"thm-expander-walk-extractor — 由扩展图游走提取弱随机源","depends_on":["[[28-df-randomness-extractor]]","[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 21.27 and proof; printed p.446; PDF p.472","source_printed_pages":"446","source_pdf_pages":"472","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","proof_status":"local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-expander-walk-extractor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-expander-walk-extractor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-expander-walk-extractor — 由扩展图游走提取弱随机源"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c3cbeaaa31fd355\" href=\"?note=0c3cbeaaa31fd355\" title=\"28-df-randomness-extractor\">28-df-randomness-extractor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3290c020cc313bd\" href=\"?note=c3290c020cc313bd\" title=\"28-thm-random-walk-mixing\">28-thm-random-walk-mixing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 21.27 and proof; printed p.446; PDF p.472"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"446"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"472"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[0,n]\">\\(k\\in[0,n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}\">\\(G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha&lt;1\">\\(\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha&lt;1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\ge0\">\\(\\alpha\\ge0\\)</span>。图、游走和谱界见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3290c020cc313bd\" href=\"?note=c3290c020cc313bd\" title=\"28-thm-random-walk-mixing\">28-thm-random-walk-mixing</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}\">\\(\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\)</span>、统计距离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c3cbeaaa31fd355\" href=\"?note=0c3cbeaaa31fd355\" title=\"28-df-randomness-extractor\">28-df-randomness-extractor</a> 及其上游。字串下标从1开始；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\">\\(z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\)</span> 唯一分成长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的块 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}\">\\(z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}\\)</span>。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_j\">\\(b_j\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_{n,k,t}\">\\(\\epsilon_{n,k,t}\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_j^{-1}\">\\(b_j^{-1}\\)</span> 为双射的逆，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^0=1\">\\(\\alpha^0=1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与均匀种子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{rt}\">\\(U_{rt}\\)</span> 独立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_j:\\{0,1\\}^j\\to[2^j],\\qquad b_j(x)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{\\ell=1}^j x_\\ell2^{j-\\ell}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_j:\\{0,1\\}^j\\to[2^j],\\qquad b_j(x)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{\\ell=1}^j x_\\ell2^{j-\\ell}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}(x,z)\\coloneqq b_n^{-1}\\left(\\operatorname{Walk}_G\\bigl(b_n(x),(b_r(z^{(1)}),\\ldots,b_r(z^{(t)}))\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}(x,z)\\coloneqq b_n^{-1}\\left(\\operatorname{Walk}_G\\bigl(b_n(x),(b_r(z^{(1)}),\\ldots,b_r(z^{(t)}))\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_{n,k,t}\\coloneqq\\min\\left\\{1,\\frac12\\alpha^t\\sqrt{2^{n-k}-1}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\epsilon_{n,k,t}\\coloneqq\\min\\left\\{1,\\frac12\\alpha^t\\sqrt{2^{n-k}-1}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\quad\\Delta(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}(X,U_{rt}),U_n)\\le\\epsilon_{n,k,t}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\quad\\Delta(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}(X,U_{rt}),U_n)\\le\\epsilon_{n,k,t}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,rt,n}(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t};k,\\epsilon_{n,k,t}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,rt,n}(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t};k,\\epsilon_{n,k,t}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条把引理21.27的游走构造展开为固定图上的精确接口与距离界；未单独断言所需图的存在性或显式构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_j\">\\(b_j\\)</span> 是包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=0\">\\(j=0\\)</span> 在内的标准二进制双射，种子分块给出独立均匀端口，因此输出列向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G^tp\">\\(P_G^tp\\)</span>。弱源满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_vp(v)^2\\le2^{-k}\\sum_vp(v)=2^{-k}\">\\(\\sum_vp(v)^2\\le2^{-k}\\sum_vp(v)=2^{-k}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|p-u_{2^n}\\|_2^2\\le2^{-k}-2^{-n}\">\\(\\|p-u_{2^n}\\|_2^2\\le2^{-k}-2^{-n}\\)</span>。将此代入游走混合界即得未截断界，距离至多1给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>。端点、逆编码和递归都唯一，所以提取器函数良定。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=1/2\">\\(\\alpha=1/2\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\ge(n-k)/2+\\log_2(1/\\epsilon)\">\\(t\\ge(n-k)/2+\\log_2(1/\\epsilon)\\)</span> 即得到误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 的充分步数，随机位数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rt\">\\(rt\\)</span>。若这些图来自固定度数的强显式族，邻点计算每步耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{poly}(n)\">\\(\\operatorname{poly}(n)\\)</span>，因此实现耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\operatorname{poly}(n)\">\\(t\\operatorname{poly}(n)\\)</span>；本节点的无条件数学断言仅依赖给定图及其谱界。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n\">\\(k=n\\)</span> 时源已均匀，误差界为0；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=0\">\\(t=0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 仍有明确含义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-randomness-extractor","status":"resolved","id":"0c3cbeaaa31fd355","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-randomness-extractor]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-random-walk-mixing","status":"resolved","id":"c3290c020cc313bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-random-walk-mixing","status":"resolved","id":"c3290c020cc313bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$k\\in[0,n]$；$G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}$ 且 $\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha<1$，$\\alpha\\ge0$。图、游走和谱界见 [[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]。$\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$、统计距离 $\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-randomness-extractor]] 及其上游。字串下标从1开始；$z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}$ 唯一分成长度 $r$ 的块 $z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}$。对所有 $j\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义 $b_j$；$\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n$ 和 $\\epsilon_{n,k,t}$ 由下式定义；$b_j^{-1}$ 为双射的逆，$\\alpha^0=1$。$X$ 与均匀种子 $U_{rt}$ 独立。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-randomness-extractor","status":"resolved","id":"0c3cbeaaa31fd355","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$k\\in[0,n]$；$G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}$ 且 $\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha<1$，$\\alpha\\ge0$。图、游走和谱界见 [[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]。$\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$、统计距离 $\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-randomness-extractor]] 及其上游。字串下标从1开始；$z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}$ 唯一分成长度 $r$ 的块 $z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}$。对所有 $j\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义 $b_j$；$\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n$ 和 $\\epsilon_{n,k,t}$ 由下式定义；$b_j^{-1}$ 为双射的逆，$\\alpha^0=1$。$X$ 与均匀种子 $U_{rt}$ 独立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[0,n]","display":false},{"tex":"G=(2^n,2^r,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{2^n,2^r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha<1","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,d,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\{0,1\\}^{rt}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"z^{(1)},\\ldots,z^{(t)}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{rt}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon_{n,k,t}","display":false},{"tex":"b_j^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"U_{rt}","display":false},{"tex":"b_j:\\{0,1\\}^j\\to[2^j],\\qquad b_j(x)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{\\ell=1}^j x_\\ell2^{j-\\ell}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}(x,z)\\coloneqq b_n^{-1}\\left(\\operatorname{Walk}_G\\bigl(b_n(x),(b_r(z^{(1)}),\\ldots,b_r(z^{(t)}))\\bigr)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\epsilon_{n,k,t}\\coloneqq\\min\\left\\{1,\\frac12\\alpha^t\\sqrt{2^{n-k}-1}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\quad\\Delta(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t}(X,U_{rt}),U_n)\\le\\epsilon_{n,k,t}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Extractor}_{n,rt,n}(\\operatorname{Ext}_{G,t};k,\\epsilon_{n,k,t}).","display":true},{"tex":"b_j","display":false},{"tex":"j=0","display":false},{"tex":"P_G^tp","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_vp(v)^2\\le2^{-k}\\sum_vp(v)=2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\|p-u_{2^n}\\|_2^2\\le2^{-k}-2^{-n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=1/2","display":false},{"tex":"t\\ge(n-k)/2+\\log_2(1/\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"rt","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{poly}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\operatorname{poly}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"k=n","display":false},{"tex":"t=0","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":2804,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"}],"outgoing":["0c3cbeaaa31fd355","c3290c020cc313bd"]}